WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:03.500
<b>Can I talk to you, Lili?</b>

00:03.880 --> 00:06.830
<b>I have a hunch about something
that might happen during the battle.</b>

00:07.500 --> 00:11.880
<b>If I'm right... it's possible that Master Hedin might help us.</b>

00:12.130 --> 00:12.790
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:13.130 --> 00:15.420
<b>Something about him is different from the others.</b>

00:15.790 --> 00:20.080
<b>Like, even before my date with Ms. Syr,
I got the impression</b>

00:20.580 --> 00:24.330
<b>that Master Hedin was solely driven
to do what's best for her.</b>

00:25.790 --> 00:29.460
<b>So, he might be making use of us
to further his own agenda.</b>

00:33.710 --> 00:36.500
<b>Master Bell's prediction really came to pass!</b>

00:37.170 --> 00:39.830
<b>Fight evermore, my immortal lightning warriors.</b>

00:39.830 --> 00:41.330
<b>Caelus Hildr.</b>

00:45.880 --> 00:48.290
<b>Huh?! No freakin' way!</b>

00:48.290 --> 00:50.460
<b>What is going on here?!</b>

00:50.750 --> 00:54.330
<b>Is Hildrsleif double crossing his own Familia?!</b>

00:54.960 --> 00:57.460
<b>Finally. There's the twist.</b>

00:58.250 --> 01:03.330
<b>The story of today, sometimes the world is irony</b>

01:03.580 --> 01:07.460
<b>"Nevertheless..." In my heart</b>

01:07.460 --> 01:13.040
<b>I found this feeling and now it's our world</b>

01:22.460 --> 01:27.920
<b>I've been here since that day, continually seeking and searching</b>

01:28.170 --> 01:34.710
<b>Whenever I encounter weaknesses,
I have to overcome them one after another</b>

01:34.710 --> 01:38.710
<b>Fighting back tears each time</b>

01:38.960 --> 01:43.750
<b>Then getting back up for tomorrow
and the day after, that's how I've lived</b>

01:43.920 --> 01:49.080
<b>Having faith in the past and advancing beyond it</b>

01:49.250 --> 01:54.040
<b>Where something irreplaceable is waiting for us</b>

01:54.250 --> 01:58.710
<b>The story of adventure, it can begin today</b>

01:59.000 --> 02:04.790
<b>To prevent anyone from glorifying the tragic elegy</b>

02:05.170 --> 02:09.670
<b>Ah, I want to become strong, our counterattack begins</b>

02:09.790 --> 02:13.210
<b>It's okay to be uncool</b>

02:13.580 --> 02:19.290
<b>Ah, encounters are love, so that's where you've been, huh?</b>

02:28.080 --> 02:31.830
<b>Revenge</b>

02:28.080 --> 02:31.830
<b>Counterattack</b>

02:33.790 --> 02:34.960
<b>What the hell?!</b>

02:35.170 --> 02:37.250
<b>What are you doing, Master Hedin?!</b>

02:37.250 --> 02:38.710
<b>Have you lost your mind?!</b>

02:39.380 --> 02:40.540
<b>Far from it.</b>

02:40.920 --> 02:45.080
<b>I simply made a judgement call
to eliminate you nuisances.</b>

02:45.290 --> 02:47.630
<b>Are you seriously betraying Lady Freya?!</b>

02:47.920 --> 02:49.420
<b>I had nothing but faith in you!</b>

02:49.420 --> 02:52.580
<b>I thought you and the Captain would defend her
to the bitter end no matter what!</b>

02:52.880 --> 02:56.290
<b>Don't assume I'm involved in some
sinister scheme against Her Ladyship.</b>

02:57.460 --> 03:00.250
<b>This transgression is necessary to uphold my loyalty.</b>

03:00.250 --> 03:01.580
<b>That's all.</b>

03:02.290 --> 03:05.710
<b>Don't you see? It's no different from what Horn did.</b>

03:07.000 --> 03:07.750
<b>Horn?</b>

03:08.330 --> 03:11.130
<b>Give me a break. Not you, too!</b>

03:11.630 --> 03:13.380
<b>You're nothing but a filthy traitor!</b>

03:13.670 --> 03:16.960
<b>How dare you talk about "loyalty" in the same breath
that you defy the will of our Goddess!</b>

03:17.460 --> 03:20.670
<b>I am the witch blessed with
this golden aura by Lady Freya!</b>

03:20.790 --> 03:22.710
<b>It's impossible to kill me!</b>

03:22.710 --> 03:23.960
<b>Silence, pig.</b>

03:25.250 --> 03:28.420
<b>Your magic power is not infinite. It can be exhausted.</b>

03:28.630 --> 03:32.580
<b>Which of us do you think has the larger pool
of magic power to draw from?</b>

03:34.170 --> 03:37.210
<b>That golden blessing falls very short of Goddesshood.</b>

03:37.630 --> 03:39.290
<b>You don't even compare to Horn.</b>

03:47.460 --> 03:49.170
<b>Hedin Selland.</b>

03:54.210 --> 03:58.380
<b>Go fight that big brute.
It will take more than one of you to win.</b>

04:09.130 --> 04:09.750
<b>Hedin?!</b>

04:10.460 --> 04:13.000
<b>I will not seek forgiveness, Lady Freya.</b>

04:13.380 --> 04:14.880
<b>I do this out of vanity.</b>

04:15.040 --> 04:18.460
<b>Brand me as a traitor if you must,
but I shall see this through to the end.</b>

04:18.540 --> 04:21.790
<b>The tides have turned! This is huge!</b>

04:22.040 --> 04:24.790
<b>Although the Freya Familia was
totally dominating a minute ago,</b>

04:24.790 --> 04:28.670
<b>the actions of one ruthless elf have
just flipped this War Game on its head!</b>

04:28.920 --> 04:33.170
<b>All bets are off now. There is a clear path
to victory for the allied army!</b>

04:33.170 --> 04:36.000
<b>Ottarl and Allen not being around
makes a huge difference.</b>

04:36.330 --> 04:40.330
<b>Making Allen leave to hunt the Gods gave
the allied army a big advantage in time and distance.</b>

04:40.710 --> 04:43.710
<b>That's true. But the Bringar won't
just take this sitting down.</b>

04:44.000 --> 04:44.880
<b>Naturally.</b>

04:45.540 --> 04:47.790
<b>This is the moment of truth, Liliruca Arde.</b>

04:53.630 --> 04:54.210
<b>Hedin?!</b>

04:54.380 --> 04:56.000
<b>Damn that stupid four-eyes!</b>

04:56.460 --> 04:57.290
<b>Time for a purge!</b>

04:57.290 --> 04:58.250
<b>Let's move!</b>

05:02.170 --> 05:02.790
<b>What was that?!</b>

05:03.040 --> 05:05.580
<b>Surprise! Did somebody call fur a hero?</b>

05:05.580 --> 05:08.670
<b>I hope you're ready for some payback! You little shits!</b>

05:09.250 --> 05:09.960
<b>The calvary's here.</b>

05:09.960 --> 05:12.040
<b>Sorry tabby late!</b>

05:12.330 --> 05:14.830
<b>You can blame it all on a certain dumb cat!</b>

05:16.170 --> 05:17.130
<b>Master Allen!</b>

05:18.130 --> 05:22.830
<b>I'm afraid that lightning blast from earlier really
was Master Hedin attacking our own troops.</b>

05:22.830 --> 05:25.830
<b>That friggin' snake! What the hell is he thinking?!</b>

05:25.830 --> 05:29.500
<b>W-worse yet, we've spotted enemy
reinforcements from the Hostess of Fertility.</b>

05:29.750 --> 05:32.580
<b>And Vana Alfi is among them...</b>

05:32.580 --> 05:34.290
<b>Are you kidding me?!</b>

05:39.460 --> 05:40.920
<b>I'm back and good as mew.</b>

05:41.630 --> 05:42.920
<b>Anya Fromel!</b>

05:42.920 --> 05:45.420
<b>Dirty alley cat! Still haven't learned your lesson?!</b>

05:45.630 --> 05:48.540
<b>I thought Lady Freya had totally broken your spirit!</b>

05:48.920 --> 05:50.380
<b>She did.</b>

05:50.880 --> 05:54.210
<b>I was feline like utter crap
and couldn't even think straight.</b>

05:54.580 --> 05:55.330
<b>But...</b>

06:00.170 --> 06:01.250
<b>Big Brother?</b>

06:04.500 --> 06:06.630
<b>Hey! Get your claws off me!</b>

06:06.880 --> 06:08.670
<b>What's the big idea?!</b>

06:08.830 --> 06:12.080
<b>We can't just barge into Lady Freya's home during
the War Game without purrmission!</b>

06:12.290 --> 06:14.290
<b>You've got more of a catty attitude than my big brother!</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:16.670
<b>I'm a WOLF, not a cat!</b>

06:16.880 --> 06:19.250
<b>Shit! This is such a pain!</b>

06:21.580 --> 06:23.920
<b>H-how is this pawssible?</b>

06:25.000 --> 06:27.540
<b>I thought Syr and Lady Freya were the same purrson!</b>

06:28.290 --> 06:30.460
<b>This girl is like a mirror or something.</b>

06:30.830 --> 06:35.330
<b>Whatever she says is a reflection of Syr's true feelings,
so she's basically just like your friend.</b>

06:36.170 --> 06:37.880
<b>Are you telling me that this Syr...</b>

06:38.790 --> 06:41.290
<b>is no diffurrent from the one I know?</b>

06:42.630 --> 06:44.960
<b>I'm sorry, Anya...</b>

06:47.040 --> 06:49.750
<b>I'm sorry, Chloe...</b>

06:50.380 --> 06:52.960
<b>I'm sorry, Lunor...</b>

06:53.670 --> 06:56.750
<b>I'm sorry, Ryu...</b>

06:58.630 --> 06:59.540
<b>Syr!</b>

07:01.920 --> 07:03.380
<b>I've got kibble fur brains.</b>

07:04.290 --> 07:08.460
<b>I don't even have the faintest idea where
the truth begins and the lies end.</b>

07:09.290 --> 07:10.080
<b>But so what?!</b>

07:10.420 --> 07:12.080
<b>I want to save my family!</b>

07:13.460 --> 07:15.460
<b>So we're gonna get the uppurr hand,</b>

07:15.460 --> 07:18.040
<b>and put a stop to Syr by winning this battle!</b>

07:21.790 --> 07:22.920
<b>Stubborn fool...</b>

07:23.790 --> 07:27.540
<b>How much longer do you insist
on getting in my way, Syr?!</b>

07:28.040 --> 07:30.750
<b>Damn you and your meddling, Loki.</b>

07:31.250 --> 07:34.830
<b>You were the only one who had caught
on to the link between me and Syr.</b>

07:47.170 --> 07:48.420
<b>I knew you'd come.</b>

07:49.250 --> 07:50.080
<b>Gale Wind.</b>

07:51.080 --> 07:51.830
<b>Ms. Ryu!</b>

07:52.290 --> 07:54.080
<b>You don't have to say anything, Bell.</b>

07:54.420 --> 07:56.210
<b>I'm sorry for being so late.</b>

07:57.000 --> 07:58.080
<b>Noah Heal.</b>

08:00.080 --> 08:02.880
<b>Unfortunately, we're still in trouble.</b>

08:03.330 --> 08:05.210
<b>The King is too strong even for the two of us.</b>

08:05.750 --> 08:06.920
<b>Heads up!</b>

08:12.500 --> 08:13.710
<b>Mama Mia!</b>

08:15.460 --> 08:16.710
<b>Hey, Mama Mia.</b>

08:17.540 --> 08:20.750
<b>Or should I say, former Captain of the Freya Familia.</b>

08:21.420 --> 08:22.830
<b>You gonna join the War Game?</b>

08:23.080 --> 08:26.130
<b>I have to abide by the contract I made with the Goddess.</b>

08:26.130 --> 08:29.290
<b>I promised not to interfere
when she finally found her Ord.</b>

08:29.670 --> 08:33.500
<b>You're seriously telling me that nymphomaniac is
destined to hook up with some twerp?</b>

08:33.670 --> 08:34.790
<b>That's dumb as hell.</b>

08:35.000 --> 08:38.920
<b>When I first met the Goddess,
can you guess what she was doing?</b>

08:39.540 --> 08:43.040
<b>Huh? Riding on her damn high horse, I bet.</b>

08:43.420 --> 08:47.040
<b>She was crying. Huddled up in a field of flowers.</b>

08:48.250 --> 08:52.210
<b>I already know that Syr represents
who she truly is at heart.</b>

08:52.960 --> 08:56.290
<b>I can't go out there and start
swinging punches against her,</b>

08:57.330 --> 08:59.880
<b>or that dumbass will snap once and for all.</b>

09:00.540 --> 09:01.670
<b>I'm almost sure of it.</b>

09:01.960 --> 09:03.000
<b>Okay.</b>

09:03.380 --> 09:07.210
<b>But have you seen Freya recently?
Cuz even she knows she's gone batshit crazy.</b>

09:07.670 --> 09:11.500
<b>Unless I hear that stupid girl ask
for help in her own words,</b>

09:11.670 --> 09:13.210
<b>I ain't going.</b>

09:14.290 --> 09:15.830
<b>I'm holding ya to that.</b>

09:18.790 --> 09:19.920
<b>Come have a look, Mia.</b>

09:22.460 --> 09:23.580
<b>Mama Mia.</b>

09:28.380 --> 09:30.500
<b>I'm sorry, Mia...</b>

09:32.290 --> 09:34.670
<b>Please, you have to stop me...</b>

09:36.290 --> 09:37.500
<b>Save me!</b>

09:39.000 --> 09:41.580
<b>You don't seem surprised, little boarlet!</b>

09:42.000 --> 09:43.920
<b>I figured you wouldn't stay still.</b>

09:44.540 --> 09:47.920
<b>I've always found that part of you
incredibly aggravating, ya know!</b>

09:48.500 --> 09:51.040
<b>Ryu! Let's wipe the floor with this fool!</b>

09:51.250 --> 09:53.540
<b>You've got a few choice words for Syr, don'tcha?</b>

09:53.750 --> 09:54.330
<b>Yes!</b>

09:54.880 --> 09:56.790
<b>Get on your feet, kid!</b>

09:56.790 --> 09:58.080
<b>It's like I told you before,</b>

09:58.080 --> 10:02.830
<b>whichever adventurer is left standing on their
two legs at the end is the best of the best.</b>

10:03.750 --> 10:04.460
<b>Right...</b>

10:06.250 --> 10:07.710
<b>Bring it, Mia!</b>

10:08.330 --> 10:11.040
<b>Shut your arrogant mouth!</b>

10:17.630 --> 10:21.040
<b>Here comes Mama Mia,
also known by the alias of "Demi Ymir"!</b>

10:21.250 --> 10:26.000
<b>She was once the leader of the Freya Familia
and packed a more powerful punch than even the King!</b>

10:26.250 --> 10:28.830
<b>This is really anybody's game now!</b>

10:29.040 --> 10:32.710
<b>Except, uh, are these tavern employees
even allowed to fight?</b>

10:32.710 --> 10:36.500
<b>I thought only Familia members of Gods who
are present on the battlefield could participate.</b>

10:36.500 --> 10:40.130
<b>No problem! Why, you ask? Because I am Ganesha!</b>

10:40.130 --> 10:41.500
<b>Hold on, can we get a real answer?</b>

10:42.170 --> 10:43.210
<b>It's not an issue.</b>

10:43.580 --> 10:45.920
<b>Lunor Faust is a member of the Demeter Familia.</b>

10:46.170 --> 10:48.790
<b>And Chloe Lolo belongs to the Njord Familia.</b>

10:50.040 --> 10:51.830
<b>I can verify that Goddess Demeter and God Njord</b>

10:52.210 --> 10:55.540
<b>arrived alongside Goddess Astrea
and are currently on the island.</b>

10:56.250 --> 10:58.380
<b>So, what you're saying is...</b>

10:58.380 --> 11:00.750
<b>I AM GANESHA!</b>

11:01.000 --> 11:02.750
<b>Hoo boy.</b>

11:03.040 --> 11:04.920
<b>Now this is what I call a real fight!</b>

11:05.540 --> 11:07.500
<b>C'mere, Bete. Let's watch together.</b>

11:08.210 --> 11:11.670
<b>Stuff it. You must be crazy if you think
I'd suffer this divine peanut gallery.</b>

11:11.670 --> 11:14.290
<b>I'm still friggin' pissed you made me haul that dumb
cat around.</b>

11:14.460 --> 11:17.540
<b>But didn't it feel good to take a bite outta the War Game?</b>

11:17.540 --> 11:20.250
<b>What an impressive puppet show, Loki.</b>

11:20.670 --> 11:23.290
<b>Only you could pull all the right
strings to get Mia on board.</b>

11:23.290 --> 11:25.330
<b>Hah. Look who's talking?</b>

11:25.330 --> 11:29.670
<b>Don't pretend that you weren't behind the scenes
pushing the right buttons to goad Astrea into the fight!</b>

11:29.880 --> 11:31.040
<b>Guilty as charged.</b>

11:31.630 --> 11:33.130
<b>Have anything else up your sleeve?</b>

11:33.130 --> 11:33.960
<b>Nope.</b>

11:34.130 --> 11:38.210
<b>From here on out, it's just an honest-to-goodness
showdown with no funny business.</b>

11:39.830 --> 11:41.920
<b>I busted my hump to set the stage for ya.</b>

11:42.330 --> 11:44.380
<b>So you better win, half-pint.</b>

11:44.920 --> 11:47.880
<b>I managed to slip away from them... hopefully.</b>

11:52.670 --> 11:55.920
<b>Yikes. Things are looking intense out there.</b>

11:55.920 --> 11:56.750
<b>Hestia!</b>

11:57.960 --> 12:01.040
<b>Miach! Thank heavens! You got away?</b>

12:01.040 --> 12:01.710
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:02.170 --> 12:04.170
<b>Naza's deodorant helped throw them off my trail.</b>

12:04.420 --> 12:07.540
<b>Same here! But what do we do now?</b>

12:07.920 --> 12:10.250
<b>How do we keep ourselves hidden?</b>

12:10.670 --> 12:12.290
<b>We should head for the frontlines.</b>

12:12.290 --> 12:13.040
<b>Huh?</b>

12:13.880 --> 12:16.830
<b>There's no sense trying to play hide-and-seek anymore.</b>

12:17.540 --> 12:19.630
<b>Both sides are just fighting to win now.</b>

12:20.080 --> 12:22.960
<b>And there's really only one thing that we can do to help.</b>

12:23.290 --> 12:25.500
<b>Oh! A status update!</b>

12:25.670 --> 12:26.460
<b>Exactly.</b>

12:26.960 --> 12:31.580
<b>The experience that our children have gained in this
battle should boost their abilities, if even just a little.</b>

12:31.920 --> 12:34.540
<b>Then let's go! Our Familias need us!</b>

12:49.750 --> 12:53.040
<b>You've toughened up quite a bit
since the last time I saw you, eh?</b>

12:53.670 --> 12:56.380
<b>Actually, you've gotten weak, Mia.</b>

12:57.710 --> 13:01.170
<b>While you were doing nothing, I kept pushing forward.</b>

13:02.040 --> 13:03.580
<b>That's all there is to it.</b>

13:04.000 --> 13:07.170
<b>I'm on top now. And you're out of my league.</b>

13:07.170 --> 13:09.000
<b>Don't get cocky with me!</b>

13:09.380 --> 13:11.130
<b>Little boarlet!</b>

13:15.750 --> 13:18.880
<b>I had no idea Ms. Mia was such a powerhouse.</b>

13:19.170 --> 13:21.000
<b>Come on! We should go help her!</b>

13:21.420 --> 13:22.380
<b>Not yet.</b>

13:22.830 --> 13:25.710
<b>You need to fully recover first,
or else you'll just get crushed out there.</b>

13:28.040 --> 13:30.500
<b>Bear with it. I'll be done soon.</b>

13:32.210 --> 13:33.130
<b>Bell.</b>

13:34.540 --> 13:36.330
<b>There's one thing I need to ask you.</b>

13:36.790 --> 13:39.210
<b>What are you planning to do with Syr?</b>

13:41.210 --> 13:43.130
<b>I'm going to drag her back home,</b>

13:43.540 --> 13:45.580
<b>and then slap some sense into her.</b>

13:46.290 --> 13:48.670
<b>I'm sure the other girls from the tavern feel the same.</b>

13:49.710 --> 13:51.380
<b>But what about you?</b>

13:51.750 --> 13:55.540
<b>When this battle is over, what are you going to do to Syr?</b>

13:56.920 --> 13:58.210
<b>I met Ms. Horn,</b>

13:59.130 --> 14:01.290
<b>who became Syr and told me herself...</b>

14:02.460 --> 14:05.330
<b>She's afraid of love driving her mad.
And wants me save her.</b>

14:07.210 --> 14:09.000
<b>So, that's what I'm going to do.</b>

14:09.330 --> 14:11.960
<b>Even though I know it will hurt her.</b>

14:12.880 --> 14:15.210
<b>Since I'm the one who drove her to this point.</b>

14:15.750 --> 14:19.290
<b>It's my fault. She's still hurting because of me.</b>

14:19.830 --> 14:23.210
<b>So I'll stick by her, in spite of all the pain that it causes.</b>

14:23.750 --> 14:27.630
<b>And keep saving her until she goes back
to being the happy person that she was before.</b>

14:29.290 --> 14:30.130
<b>Bell...</b>

14:31.210 --> 14:33.210
<b>You really are the worst kind of hypocrite.</b>

14:33.880 --> 14:36.420
<b>I know. I'll totally admit to that.</b>

14:36.750 --> 14:39.290
<b>But this is the one hypocritical thing
I have to hold my ground on.</b>

14:40.040 --> 14:42.420
<b>Even if she ends up hurt all over again,</b>

14:42.420 --> 14:43.710
<b>I will stop her!</b>

14:47.750 --> 14:49.710
<b>All done. Let's go.</b>

14:49.710 --> 14:50.500
<b>Okay!</b>

14:51.170 --> 14:51.880
<b>Bell.</b>

14:52.500 --> 14:54.580
<b>There's one thing that you should know.</b>

14:57.040 --> 14:59.000
<b>I have feelings for you.</b>

14:59.290 --> 15:00.170
<b>What?!</b>

15:01.420 --> 15:03.000
<b>The romantic kind.</b>

15:05.670 --> 15:08.500
<b>I'm in love with you.</b>

15:10.830 --> 15:12.330
<b>Now it's fair.</b>

15:12.880 --> 15:14.670
<b>I can slap Syr without restraint!</b>

15:27.960 --> 15:28.830
<b>Take this.</b>

15:32.250 --> 15:33.500
<b>An earring?</b>

15:33.750 --> 15:36.630
<b>It's a magic item we purrsuaded Perseus to make.</b>

15:36.830 --> 15:38.790
<b>It's impawtent you hand them out to your friends!</b>

15:39.130 --> 15:40.130
<b>Will do.</b>

15:43.250 --> 15:47.330
<b>The only opposing first-class adventurers left
on the battlefield right now are the Bringar.</b>

15:48.040 --> 15:51.290
<b>But it's only a matter of time
before Vana Freya comes back.</b>

15:55.290 --> 15:58.790
<b>We have to defeat the Bringar ASAP.
Or we'll lose our chance to win.</b>

15:59.210 --> 16:02.500
<b>But the teamwork of those four is flawless!</b>

16:05.380 --> 16:08.080
<b>"Thou art a kitten, a wheel gone astray."</b>

16:08.710 --> 16:11.130
<b>"I am a teardrop, a weeping servant."</b>

16:11.630 --> 16:14.170
<b>"Inquiring of home, I receive no answer."</b>

16:14.170 --> 16:16.290
<b>"Asking the crow, it proves uncertain."</b>

16:16.790 --> 16:18.830
<b>"Therefore I weep."</b>

16:19.170 --> 16:20.040
<b>"All by myself."</b>

16:20.460 --> 16:21.250
<b>A spell?!</b>

16:20.460 --> 16:22.500
<b>"As I chant upon your back."</b>

16:21.580 --> 16:23.040
<b>And it's almost complete!</b>

16:23.580 --> 16:25.750
<b>"Please do not leave me behind."</b>

16:26.460 --> 16:28.000
<b>Remiste Felis!</b>

16:28.330 --> 16:38.630
<b>MEOOOOOOOOOW!</b>

16:43.580 --> 16:46.460
<b>I feel so weak! Is this a status debuff?!</b>

16:47.710 --> 16:48.710
<b>What?!</b>

16:49.080 --> 16:51.170
<b>That damn idiot!</b>

16:56.750 --> 17:01.630
<b>Helping Syr is my bigger priority right now.
So I'll even fight against you, Big Brother!</b>

17:03.630 --> 17:06.130
<b>Hell yeah, that should've knocked
those chumps down a peg or two!</b>

17:06.290 --> 17:09.420
<b>You're in fur a world of hurt!
Anya's horrible singing was just the start!</b>

17:09.880 --> 17:11.000
<b>Curse you!</b>

17:13.250 --> 17:16.040
<b>That put the Gulliver brothers on the defensive.</b>

17:16.500 --> 17:18.790
<b>Now we just need a way to disrupt their teamwork...</b>

17:24.290 --> 17:27.330
<b>Lady Aisha! Lady Mikoto! Lady Naza! Lady Haruhime!</b>

17:27.330 --> 17:28.790
<b>I have a strategy!</b>

17:29.630 --> 17:33.380
<b>What should we do, Samira?!
Haruhime can't risk using her spell right now...</b>

17:34.000 --> 17:35.750
<b>Or else everybody learns about Level Boost.</b>

17:36.130 --> 17:39.330
<b>Aisha told us it was better to just run away
than letting it become public knowledge.</b>

17:39.500 --> 17:44.750
<b>Okay. Then the next time Lady Haruhime activates
her spell will also be the signal to enact the plan!</b>

17:45.710 --> 17:47.670
<b>Understood. I'll start casting it.</b>

17:47.670 --> 17:49.460
<b>But you can't, Haruhime!</b>

17:49.750 --> 17:51.460
<b>The entirety of Orario is watching this!</b>

17:51.460 --> 17:54.790
<b>It'll be just like what happened with Lady Ishtar.
People will come after you for that power!</b>

17:54.790 --> 17:55.880
<b>I don't care!</b>

17:57.500 --> 18:00.210
<b>My personal safety isn't what really matters at this point.</b>

18:00.210 --> 18:03.250
<b>I'm not a harbinger of ruin anymore!</b>

18:03.710 --> 18:06.710
<b>I've changed. I'm Haruhime of the Hestia Familia!</b>

18:08.210 --> 18:10.250
<b>Now that's what I call backbone.</b>

18:10.670 --> 18:12.250
<b>Alright, let's do this.</b>

18:12.250 --> 18:14.330
<b>If anybody comes for you, we'll stop 'em dead!</b>

18:14.330 --> 18:16.000
<b>Huh?! You can't be serious!</b>

18:17.790 --> 18:18.670
<b>Kokonoe!</b>

18:19.750 --> 18:25.250
<b>"Oh beloved snow, oh beloved crimson,
oh beloved light..."</b>

18:28.290 --> 18:29.750
<b>Uchide no Kozuchi!</b>

18:30.330 --> 18:31.790
<b>Dance and whirl!</b>

18:32.790 --> 18:34.290
<b>Why that klutzy fox...</b>

18:34.580 --> 18:35.710
<b>Spring the trap!</b>

18:38.880 --> 18:39.830
<b>A smokescreen?!</b>

18:40.130 --> 18:42.170
<b>They're trying to prevent us from working together!</b>

18:42.830 --> 18:44.500
<b>Futsu no Mitama!</b>

18:48.250 --> 18:50.250
<b>Damn, this is a gravity spell!</b>

18:50.880 --> 18:53.000
<b>Two o'clock! There are no enemies to the northeast!</b>

18:54.500 --> 18:56.290
<b>Bering! Excellent work!</b>

18:58.460 --> 18:59.210
<b>Nice try!</b>

19:03.500 --> 19:04.670
<b>Give up!</b>

19:06.330 --> 19:07.790
<b>You don't stand a chance!</b>

19:11.580 --> 19:13.290
<b>What are you standing there for, Bering?!</b>

19:16.880 --> 19:18.080
<b>Wait, who the hell are you?!</b>

19:26.670 --> 19:28.330
<b>No way! A transformation spell?!</b>

19:28.880 --> 19:30.710
<b>My brothers! Regroup!</b>

19:31.290 --> 19:32.170
<b>Not happening!</b>

19:36.630 --> 19:38.830
<b>Dammit! We've been split up!</b>

19:40.460 --> 19:43.540
<b>Time for you little shits to get what's coming to you.</b>

19:44.130 --> 19:45.290
<b>Fat chance!</b>

19:49.130 --> 19:50.790
<b>No brothers to help you now!</b>

19:51.040 --> 19:53.080
<b>You're just a punching bag!</b>

20:02.080 --> 20:03.210
<b>An illusion spell?!</b>

20:03.210 --> 20:04.750
<b>Feles Cruz!</b>

20:06.790 --> 20:08.920
<b>Nope! Wrong again!</b>

20:13.040 --> 20:14.880
<b>My body's going numb!</b>

20:14.880 --> 20:17.250
<b>A poison delivery especially fur you.</b>

20:17.500 --> 20:19.580
<b>What's the matter? Cat got your tongue?</b>

20:19.580 --> 20:22.750
<b>Doesn't feel so great being treated like crap, does it?!</b>

20:27.790 --> 20:31.210
<b>But guess what? I feel on top of the world right now.</b>

20:37.500 --> 20:38.710
<b>"The shadows spread."</b>

20:39.460 --> 20:40.750
<b>"The darkness falls."</b>

20:41.580 --> 20:44.130
<b>"My one-armed body represents a crown of decay."</b>

20:44.880 --> 20:47.210
<b>You're the archer who shot those swords!</b>

20:45.210 --> 20:48.040
<b>"Wicked insects, festering in the flesh."</b>

20:48.040 --> 20:49.460
<b>"And defiling the soul."</b>

20:49.460 --> 20:52.130
<b>"They torment my silver with a writhing hum."</b>

20:52.420 --> 20:54.250
<b>You worthless piece of trash!</b>

20:56.630 --> 20:58.210
<b>Here. This is for you.</b>

20:58.790 --> 20:59.830
<b>Dubh Daol!</b>

21:01.790 --> 21:03.540
<b>Not another debuff!</b>

21:03.880 --> 21:05.170
<b>You scum and your cheap tricks!</b>

21:05.830 --> 21:07.460
<b>Thanks for keeping him busy, Lady Naza!</b>

21:08.670 --> 21:10.080
<b>Zekka!</b>

21:14.920 --> 21:18.290
<b>Damn sacks of crap! How could we fall for their trap?!</b>

21:18.670 --> 21:20.750
<b>"Come forth, champion of valor!"</b>

21:21.130 --> 21:23.460
<b>"Ravenous blade, thy name is Hippolyta!"</b>

21:25.210 --> 21:27.210
<b>HELL KAIOS!</b>

21:34.210 --> 21:37.830
<b>Good news, pipsqueak! WE WON!</b>

21:43.790 --> 21:46.710
<b>Thank you, everybody! Great work!</b>

21:47.960 --> 21:51.040
<b>Now it's just down to Vana Freya and...</b>

21:51.040 --> 21:52.130
<b>the King!</b>

22:19.080 --> 22:21.710
<b>This secret sinks</b>

22:21.710 --> 22:24.170
<b>Into the undulating water's surface</b>

22:24.580 --> 22:28.750
<b>There was apparently enough room to notice</b>

22:29.540 --> 22:36.250
<b>Though unable to express them clearly, my pure-white feelings</b>

22:36.250 --> 22:39.420
<b>Once again become desires when called out</b>

22:39.420 --> 22:44.420
<b>These eager emotions surge just like waves</b>

22:44.790 --> 22:50.000
<b>Swelling up unknowingly with a gentle tingle</b>

22:51.080 --> 22:57.630
<b>And after the wall dividing us crumbled, the words I understood</b>

22:57.750 --> 23:02.080
<b>Simply float unsteadily in the sky</b>

23:02.580 --> 23:08.130
<b>I want a love that grows bountiful even if it's empty</b>

23:08.380 --> 23:13.710
<b>If this is a dream I might as well take the lies out, too</b>

23:13.710 --> 23:17.380
<b>Even a life that cannot be stolen</b>

23:17.500 --> 23:22.960
<b>Changes the heart by filling it a little</b>

23:23.250 --> 23:28.920
<b>An innocent mist that's like a dizzy spell</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Einherjar</b>

23:36.090 --> 23:41.040
<b>The Warriors of the Goddess</b>

23:36.830 --> 23:39.170
<b>Next time: "Einherjar".</b>
